Package: pocket-home
Architecture: armhf
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, network-manager, x-terminal-emulator
Description: pocket-home is a home screen for PocketCHIP.
 pocket-home is a home screen for PocketCHIP. It can launch programs and change
 system settings. Wifi status is read via nmcli; wifi configuration is handled by
 nmtui launched in a terminal (no libnm-glib dependency).
